From 895bf3333ffb23758ada0d7a1cd32059df805689 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 14:08:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix: restore exact Xbox IRP ABI and lifetime

Restore the exact title-visible packet shape, isolate kernel-private lifetime state, reject zero-length direct-I/O MDLs, and add cold-restart persistence coverage.
